      "id": "ioniq-5",
      "name": "2025 Hyundai Ioniq 5 SEL",
      "story": [
        "The EV that started it all! After I helped someone lease an Ioniq 6, I realized that lease deals on these were extremely affordable.",
        "This thing is a beast. Super fast in every way, both vehicle speed and especially charging speed. It has a ton of room, it's quiet, it's comfortable, it handles well, it has a fantastic range. It's just the best vehicle I've ever had."
