    {
      "id": "kona",
      "name": "2024 Hyundai Kona Electric SEL",
      "story": [
        "I got lucky with this one - I found it for sale only a few hours after it was posted and managed to beat everyone else to the punch. It was exactly 2 years and 1 month from delivery when I got it, but the previous owner was a rideshare driver and already put 114,000 miles on it! I got it for an absolutely amazing price, and I'm totally in love with it. It's really efficient, packaged well, surprisingly quick, and the best part about it has to be the color - mirage green. I get so many compliments on the color, and I love green!",
        "The battery seems to have degraded very little as I still get near the EPA estimated range in the summer. It needed very few repairs. I didn't like the cloth interior, so I reupholstered it in leather, which was a fantastic idea. It's super soft and much nicer than the normal Hyundai leather."
      ],
