    {
      "id": "e46",
      "name": "2000 BMW 323i",
      "story": [
        "The E46 was one of my dream cars, and this did not disappoint. I eventually replaced every single suspension component except the springs. It was a lot of fun to drive, and the clutch/shifter was actually really nice, especially for a BMW. I did install a short shifter from a 545i, which helped tremendously. I sold this when I went all EV. It was a ton of fun to drive on twisty back roads, but I rarely got the opportunity to do that."
      ],
