    {
      "id": "c219",
      "name": "2010 Mercedes-Benz CLS550",
      "story": [
        "This was a pretty cool car. It had air suspension, which ended up being super easy to work on. Actually, the whole car was easy to work on. I loved the styling and pillarless doors. I think this is the most beautiful car I've ever owned. However, I never really fell in love with it, so I only owned it about a year before selling it."
